## create new ingredient
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/create-stock-ingredients
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1
{
  "image_url": "imagepath/image.png",
  "ingredient_name": "นมจืดสดวิป",
  "net_volume": 250,
  "unit": "g",
  "quantity_in_stock": 4,
  "category_name": "น้ำชง",
  "expiration_date": "2025-05-29"
}

